  {
    "episode_id": 71236,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/1/71236.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 3,
    "turn_text": "Well, we start with a windfall of sorts headed to the state of Illinois under the American Rescue Plan, billions of dollars coming to the state from the federal government. But windfalls ain't what they used to be, and this one may not go as far as maybe some people are hoping. What do we know about how the state is thinking about spending these billions of federal dollars?",
