        "text": "The state of Illinois is receiving billions of dollars from the federal government under the American Rescue Plan.",
        "confidence": 0.97
      },
      {
        "text": "This influx of funds constitutes a windfall for the state of Illinois.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Windfalls are less impactful now than they were in the past.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Some people may have overly optimistic expectations about the impact of this funding.",
