        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Public expectations about government spending are influenced by prior experiences with similar funding.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "State governments are expected to prioritize transparency in their budgetary decision-making.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
