    "turn_text": "and you have to also be very cautious about using one-time dollars for anything that could be a recurring expense. It seems like it makes a lot more sense to pay down the backlog of bills, pay down the borrowing, rather than invest in new programs, because if it's a new program, then it's got to be sustained after that federal money runs out.",
