        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Using one-time funds for permanent needs leads to future fiscal instability.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "There is a moral imperative to prioritize debt reduction over new initiatives.",
        "confidence": 0.9
